      ],
      "text": "3. Research gaps",
      "font": "SegoeUI",
      "size": 32.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        180.51710510253906,
        527.4764404296875,
        194.96009826660156
      ],
      "text": "The review of evidence for the current update exposed additional knowledge gaps to those",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        193.7171173095703,
        527.20458984375,
        208.1601104736328
      ],
      "text": "reported in other recent updates of the guidelines. Continued research on development and on",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        205.64112854003906,
        527.3109741210938,
        221.36012268066406
      ],
      "text": "(136) implementation remains critical for many aspects of PMTPT  . Some information can be collected",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 10.989645004272461,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        220.1171417236328,
        162.0001220703125,
        234.5601348876953
      ],
      "text": "from user feedback.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        248.54833984375,
        369.2041015625,
        273.3433532714844
      ],
      "text": "Risks for progression to TB disease",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 19.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        278.7943115234375,
        527.205322265625,
        293.2373352050781
      ],
      "text": "Evidence of the likelihood of progression from infection to TB disease, including MDR/RR-TB, in",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        291.99432373046875,
        527.4190063476562,
        306.4373474121094
      ],
      "text": "different populations at risk will help in determining the potential benefits of TPT and in designing",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        305.1943359375,
        527.4080200195312,
        319.6373596191406
      ],
      "text": "appropriate public health interventions. In particular, strong evidence from individually randomized",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        318.394287109375,
        527.466552734375,
        332.8373107910156
      ],
      "text": "controlled clinical trials is lacking, particularly for indigenous populations and people with the following:",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.952396392822266,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        331.59429931640625,
        527.4299926757812,
        346.0373229980469
      ],
      "text": "diabetes, harmful use of alcohol, tobacco smoking, underweight, fibrotic lesions in the lung on CXR,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        344.7943115234375,
        527.4132690429688,
        359.2373352050781
      ],
      "text": "on steroid treatment, with rheumatological diseases, chronic kidney disease, cancer or COVID-19.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        357.9942932128906,
        527.5504760742188,
        372.43731689453125
      ],
      "text": "Methods for measuring TB incidence directly and also the risk for TB disease could be explored, such",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.999199867248535,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        371.1943054199219,
        527.4097900390625,
        385.6373291015625
      ],
      "text": "as use of genotyping to distinguish between reactivation and reinfection. Evidence is also required",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        384.3943176269531,
        527.3777465820312,
        398.83734130859375
      ],
      "text": "on differential harm and the acceptability of testing and treating TBI in specific risk groups, including",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        397.59429931640625,
        280.8717346191406,
        412.037353515625
      ],
      "text": "stigmatization. socially adverse effects such as",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        426.0255126953125,
        523.885009765625,
        450.8205261230469
      ],
      "text": "Defining the best algorithm for screening and ruling",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 19.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        448.82550048828125,
        194.73638916015625,
        473.6205139160156
      ],
      "text": "out TB disease",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 19.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        479.0714111328125,
        527.4200439453125,
        493.5144348144531
      ],
      "text": "Operational and clinical studies should be conducted to exclude TB disease before TPT is given. The",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        492.2713928222656,
        527.423583984375,
        506.71441650390625
      ],
      "text": "performance and feasibility of the algorithms proposed in these guidelines should be assessed. Data",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        505.471435546875,
        527.4034423828125,
        519.9144287109375
      ],
      "text": "on children and pregnant women in particular are limited. Better evidence is necessary to identify",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        518.67138671875,
        527.6073608398438,
        533.1143798828125
      ],
      "text": "the best strategies for tracing contacts, saving costs and improving feasibility (e.g. use of mobile CXR,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.991847038269043,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        531.8715209960938,
        241.12892150878906,
        546.3145141601562
      ],
      "text": "including CAD, in people < 15 years).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86605834960938,
        553.575439453125,
        527.443115234375,
        568.0184326171875
      ],
      "text": "For all populations and tools, more research is required to evaluate the accuracy and effectiveness",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86605834960938,
        566.775390625,
        527.4345703125,
        581.2183837890625
      ],
      "text": "of complete screening and diagnostic algorithms, including symptom screening, CXR, CRP, mWRDs",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86605834960938,
        579.9754028320312,
        527.406982421875,
        594.4183959960938
      ],
      "text": "and other tools used in various combinations with diagnostic evaluation to rule out TB. Research",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86605834960938,
        593.17529296875,
        527.428466796875,
        607.6182861328125
      ],
      "text": "on their effectiveness should include measures of the impact on patient-important outcomes, such",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86605834960938,
        606.3754272460938,
        527.4453735351562,
        620.8184204101562
      ],
      "text": "as mortality and treatment success. For people with HIV in settings with different TB burdens, more",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        619.575439453125,
        524.3837890625,
        634.0184326171875
      ],
      "text": "research is necessary to evaluate the accuracy and predictive value of measuring CRP above any cut-",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.993398666381836,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        632.775390625,
        527.3663940429688,
        647.2183837890625
      ],
      "text": "off higher than 5 mg/L for TB screening, when it is used either alone or in combination with other",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        645.9754028320312,
        527.4387817382812,
        660.4183959960938
      ],
      "text": "screening tests. More data are also necessary on the effectiveness, cost–effectiveness, feasibility and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        659.17529296875,
        527.5035400390625,
        673.6182861328125
      ],
      "text": "acceptability, frequency and optimal periodicity of routine, regular screening with the W4SS, CRP,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        672.3753662109375,
        527.4493408203125,
        686.818359375
      ],
      "text": "CXR and mWRD among people with HIV. More research is also required on the potential value of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        685.5753784179688,
        409.531005859375,
        700.0184326171875
      ],
      "text": "screening people with HIV with mWRDs on specimens other than sputum.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        545.8001708984375,
        801.0170288085938,
        554.0401611328125,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "33",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
